Benchmark data
--------------

`netlib/` contains MPS files from the Netlib linear programming test set,
a long-standing public benchmark collection distributed by Netlib
(https://www.netlib.org/lp/). These files are not original to this repository
and are included unmodified so that the reported measurements can be
reproduced. They retain whatever terms attach to the original collection.

`cpp/twalker/fixtures_panel/` contains compact binary and JSON re-encodings of
those same Netlib models, produced by `cpp/twalker/tools/export_fixtures.py`.
They are a format conversion of the Netlib data, not new data.


